; ⚠️ THE TOWN HUB HAS NO ROAD AXIS ANY MORE (Phase 44). RoadAxis was 1 and the shader drew a 6.5 m
; strip straight through the middle of the square — which is exactly what the rebuild removed. The
; Kingsway is an S: in from the south at x = -11 (lined up with the Embermarket's Gate Lane across
; the seam), east to the road head the player spawns on at (0, 15), north past the square's flank,
; then north-west out to the Crossway at x = -6. The three segments below ARE that road, and they
; match the ground skins in town_hub.tscn one for one.
;
; ⚠️ THE CELL CENTRE, SpawnPoint AND SafeZoneCenter ARE UNCHANGED and this rebuild was laid out
; around them rather than the other way round: the spawn at world (0, 1.2, 5) is cell-local (0, 15),
; and Path_town_kingsway_s is drawn so the player wakes up standing ON the road with the inn on the
; left and nothing yet visible of the square. Move the road and that first second stops working.
[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Path_town_kingsway_s"]
script = ExtResource("6_path")
Start = Vector2(-11, 30)
End = Vector2(1, 14)
Width = 4.5
Shoulder = 1.5

