; ⚠️ THE CROSSWAY'S ROAD IS NO LONGER A CARDINAL STRIP (Phase 44). RoadAxis was 1 and the shader drew
; a 7 m north-south road straight through the cell — which meant the gate could be RUN, and a toll you
; can run is scenery. The road now enters at x = -6 (aligned with the town hub's Kingsway across the
; seam at world z = -40), is turned east by the palisade line, crosses the whole Holding Yard, passes a
