; ⚠️ THE NORTHERN WILDS FORK (Phase 44). The road used to be one 5 m strip from the Crossway seam at
; (0, 25) to a ruin at (0, -6) and then nothing — a corridor with a dead end, in the cell the
; EncounterDirector uses most. It now SPLITS at (0, 16) and rejoins at the arena seam (0, -25), with
; the ruin sitting BETWEEN the two branches so the loot is somewhere you turn off the road for. Both
; seam points are unchanged: crossway_post leaves at world (0, -92) and the arena's gate path begins
; at world (0, -142), which are this cell's (0, 25) and (0, -25).
