; ⚠️ HOLLOWREACH ENTERS FROM THE EAST AT z = 12, NOT z = 0 (Phase 44). The Embermarket's Dock Stair
; leaves that cell at market-local (-26, 12) — world (-26, 58) — so the wharf's boardwalk has to meet
; it there or the two districts do not join. The old road ran along z ≈ 0 and the two cells simply did
; not connect on the ground; nothing anywhere said so.
